  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.6.0-preview.14\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at feature/signing -->\n## What's Changed\n### New Features 🎉\n* Update CorrespondenceClient with API changes by @danielskovli in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1083\n### Bugfixes 🐛\n* Used 'checkedAction' to find userActionHandler, which ment sign action handler was always ran for signing process next.\n### Other Changes\n* Remove self identified users as a special case in  by @martinothamar in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1241\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.6.0-preview.13...v8.6.0-preview.14",
